 "html": "<div class=\"pset\">\n    <div class=\"pset-head\"><svg class=\"pset-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#app-mark\"></use></svg><div><div class=\"pset-name\">Pinned <span class=\"pset-ver\">0.1.11</span></div><div class=\"pset-sum\">18 bookmarks in 10 folders, 1 in the Trash</div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"pset-lbl\">Save</div>\n    <a class=\"sr\" href=\"/bookmarklet\"><span class=\"sr-ic\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-all\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"sr-t\"><span>How to save</span><span class=\"sr-s\">Bookmarklet and extension</span></span><span class=\"sr-ch\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chev\"></use></svg></span></a><button type=\"button\" class=\"sr\" data-a=\"tokens\"><span class=\"sr-ic\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-key\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"sr-t\"><span>API tokens</span><span class=\"sr-s\">No tokens yet</span></span><span class=\"sr-ch\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chev\"></use></svg></span></button>\n    <div class=\"pset-lbl\">Data</div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"sr\" data-a=\"import\"><span class=\"sr-ic\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-import\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"sr-t\"><span>Import</span><span class=\"sr-s\">A bookmarks file from any browser</span></span><span class=\"sr-ch\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chev\"></use></svg></span></button><a class=\"sr\" href=\"/api/export\"><span class=\"sr-ic\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-export\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"sr-t\"><span>Export</span><span class=\"sr-s\">bookmarks.html, written nightly too</span></span><span class=\"sr-ch\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chev\"></use></svg></span></a>\n    <div class=\"pset-lbl\">About</div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"sr\" data-a=\"releases\"><span class=\"sr-ic\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-clock\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"sr-t\"><span>What's new</span><span class=\"sr-s\">Pinned 0.1.11</span></span><span class=\"sr-ch\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chev\"></use></svg></span></button><a class=\"sr\" href=\"https://github.com/pinned-cc/pinned\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"sr-ic\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-open\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"sr-t\"><span>Source</span><span class=\"sr-s\">Open source, AGPL-3.0</span></span><span class=\"sr-ch\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-open\"></use></svg></span></a>\n    <div class=\"pset-lbl\"></div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"sr\" data-a=\"sessions\"><span class=\"sr-ic\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-lock\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"sr-t\"><span>Signed in</span><span class=\"sr-s\">Your browsers, sign out others</span></span><span class=\"sr-ch\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chev\"></use></svg></span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"sr warn hue-bin\" data-a=\"logout\"><span class=\"sr-ic\"><svg class=\"i \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-logout\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"sr-t\"><span>Log out</span></span></button>\n  </div>",
